      {
       "text": "No Traditional Web job is stamped by the O11 suite (tests/provenance-o11.json): every statement here is C-suite (static) evidence; no Traditional negative job exists.",
       "origin": "kernel/tests/provenance-o11.json; kernel/tests/jobs-negative (scan 2026-09-23)"
      },
      {
       "text": "The html document form creates new Traditional screens/blocks (traditional-html-frontend.json). Existing-root HTML edits, component/React forms and screen archetypes remain unsupported. Queries belong in Preparation. Unsupported document markup is refused explicitly.",
       "origin": "kernel/src/Anvil.Core/Kernel/ScreenExpander.cs:33; HtmlExpander.cs:68; ScreenSpecification.cs:11,53,89"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional web widget contract tests (tests/contracts/screen-coverage/traditional-ui-*, 44 cases with native Verify, reload, 3-way merge and a rejected mutation) exist outside the job suites; their evidence is historical (not stamped).",
       "origin": "kernel/tests/Anvil.Tests/ScreenCoverageTests.cs; kernel/.local/screen-coverage (2026-09-22)"
      },
      {
       "text": "The native-import mechanism of the UI source route (outsystems:Module/Flow/Block) only resolves Reactive/Mobile blocks; the discovery `instanceSource` of a capture signature is mapped for MobileBlock only.",
       "origin": "kernel/src/Anvil.Core/Kernel/UiNativeImports.cs:9-51; platforms/odc/facade/discovery.mjs signatureOf"
      },
      {
       "text": "In a Traditional UI flow the connector between two web screens (list -> detail) is created by the Studio when a destination is set, not by the headless kernel: the job links the screens explicitly (link {from: <list screen>, to: <detail screen>}).",
       "origin": "job:screen-crud-traditional (_why of the link between  and ; stamped)"
      }
     ],
     "differences": [
      "Preparation instead of lifecycle events",
      "IWebEmail instead of IMobileEmail",
      "OutSystemsUIWeb blocks instead of OutSystemsUI"
     ]
    }
